Package: niro-control
Version: @VERSION@
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: nerufuyo <local@localhost>
Depends: gnome-shell (>= 46), dconf-cli, libgtk-4-1, libvulkan1, fontconfig, gjs, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1
Replaces: neru-isle, neru-macos-dock, neru-digup-shell, neru-desktop-defaults
Conflicts: neru-isle, neru-macos-dock, neru-digup-shell, neru-desktop-defaults
Description: Niro Control: the look of the desktop in one place
 Island (the island on the top bar), the macOS-style dock, an application search, and one control panel
 (org.niro.control: tone, opacity, blur) that sets them all. Local build.
